EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I guess waking up early isn't so bad.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Especially if it means I get to talk to
you, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Levantarse pronto no está mal.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sobre todo si así puedo hablar
contigo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Alzarsi presto non è poi male.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Soprattutto se posso parlare
con te, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Erken kalkmak o kadar da kötü değilmiş.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Özellikle seninle
konuşabileceksem, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ziyaretime gelmene bayılıyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. Burada sana kapı her zaman
açık, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non c'è niente di meglio di quattro
chiacchiere in relax con gli amici.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Lo adoooro,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Schön, dich wiederzusehen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hier bist du immer willkommen,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hallo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Jetzt, wo du hier bist, könnten wir
fast eine Pyjama-Party machen!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wow, it's already {{TAG:0004:0003:}}:{{TAG:0004:0004:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Are you
sure you don't need to get home?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Not that I'm kicking you out!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Me río mucho hablando contigo.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Podría pasarme la noche entera
escuchando tus historias!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}È così divertente chiacchierare
con te, che non so più che ore sono.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Potrei andare avanti tutta la notte!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Seninle vakit geçirmek çok eğlenceli.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Zamanın nasıl geçtiğini
anlamak çok kolay!
